{"strongs": "H0623", "word": "אָסָף", "translit": "a.saph", "root": "אסף", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "gatherer", "definition": "אָסָף proper name, masculine ( gatherer , compare Phoenician proper name, feminine אספת ) 1. father of יוֺאָח the recorder 2Kgs 18:18 ; 2Kgs 18:37 = Isa 36:3 ; Isa 36:22 . 2. one of David's chief musicians, a Levite, son of Berechiah 1Chr 6:24 (twice in verse) (|| הֵימָן v. 1Chr 6:18 , אֵיתָן v. 1Chr 6:29 see these names); 1Chr 15:17 (|| Heman & Ethan, all called) הַמְּשֹׁרֲרִים v 1Chr 15:19 see also 1Chr 16:5 (twice in verse); 1Chr 16:7 compare v 1Chr 16:37 (|| Heman & Jeduthun v 1Chr 16:41 v 1Chr 16:42 ); 1Chr 25:9 , named with Heman & Jeduthun also 1Chr 25:6 ; 2Chr 5:12 ; 2Chr 35:15 ; Ps 50:1 ; Ps 73:1-83:18 are ascribed to Asaph; compare also בִּימֵי דָוִיד וְאָסָף Neh 12:46 he is called also הַחֹזֶה 2Chr 29:30 , compare אָסָף הַנִּבָּא עַליְֿדֵיהַמֶּלֶךְ 1Chr 25:2 repeated mention is made also of sons of Asaph בְּנֵיאָֿסָף , sons, descendants, and pupils, or those who sang and played after his manner 1Chr 25:1 (|| Heman & Jeduthun) v 1Chr 25:2 v 1Chr 25:2 called הַמְּשֹׁרֲרִים 2Chr 35:15 ; Ezra 2:41 ; Neh 7:44 ; Neh 11:22 , compare Ezra 3:10 performing service of purification, Hezekiah's time 2Chr 29:13 one of them prophesying 2Chr 20:14 — 1Chr 26:1 for בְּנֵי אָסָף read בְּנֵי אֶבְיָסָף , compare 1Chr 9:19 on זִכְרִי 1Chr 9:15 , זַבְדִּי Neh 11:17 , זַכּוּר Neh 12:35 , called בֶּןאָֿסָף , see these names. 3. keeper of king's park Neh 2:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB629')\">BDB629</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H623')\">H623</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB628')\">BDB628</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB630')\">BDB630</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אָסָף</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>gatherer</highlight>, compare Phoenician proper name, feminine <bdbheb>אספת</bdbheb>) <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> father